MLX after 0.32.5 (ml-explore/mlx#4734, sliding window attention) inserted
`int window_size = -1` into fast::scaled_dot_product_attention before
`mask_mode`; the pinned mlx-c @56b2d39 predates that and passes the mask mode
string in its place, which fails to compile. Shim: pass -1 (no window), the
default every existing caller gets today. The C ABI has no surface for it yet.

--- a/mlx/c/fast.cpp
+++ b/mlx/c/fast.cpp
@@ -620,6 +620,8 @@ extern "C" int mlx_fast_scaled_dot_product_attention(
             mlx_array_get_(keys),
             mlx_array_get_(values),
             scale,
+            /* window_size: no C ABI surface yet */
+            -1,
             std::string(mask_mode),
             (mask_arr.ctx ? std::make_optional(mlx_array_get_(mask_arr))
                           : std::nullopt),
